message: 'If you use this repository or data, please cite it as below.'
title: 'Sexueller Missbrauch im Umfeld der katholischen Kirche in der Schweiz: Data and Code'
abstract: 'This repository serves as the data and code archive for the technical framework of a historical research project investigating sexual abuse in the Swiss Catholic Church since the mid-20th century. It contains data models, schemas, documentation, deployment configuration, and analysis scaffolding; it does not contain real personal research data.'
